    {
     "t": "code",
     "text": "WHERE THE FUNNEL LEAKS"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Great content, wasted by generic outbound"
    },
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "You grow the founder’s audience - then bolt Clay, ChatGPT, and HeyReach onto the retainer to message them. It’s ~$753/mo per client in tools, hours of setup, and the DMs read nothing like the posts that earned the engagement. The warm audience you built gets cold outreach."
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/cSfuUaRCe6mtjQgGygGXc0Ms.png",
     "box": "1344x56"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "The content works. The DMs don't."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "You earn the engagement, then send templated connection requests that sound like a different company wrote them. The voice breaks the moment outbound starts."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "TONE MISMATCH KILLS THE WARM AUDIENCE"
    },
